\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.1}{\ignorespaces Visual comparison of SR methods on a Sentinel-2 tile. The LR input (top-left) is degraded via the Wald protocol; bicubic SR (top-right) produces smooth, overshot output; EDSR-small SR (bottom-left) recovers sharper textures; the HR reference (bottom-right) is the ground truth.}}{14}{figure.caption.9}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6.2}{\ignorespaces Full comparison panel: LR input, bicubic SR, EDSR SR, and HR reference side by side.}}{15}{figure.caption.10}%
